{
    "title": "Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle",
    "description": "Embark on a journey into the wood with a brand new theme game \"Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle\". Immerse yourself in this vibrant 3D gaming experience that combines simplicity with a delightful level of challenge, ensuring you'll be captivated in no time.\r\n\r\nIt's time to nurture your cognitive abilities by engaging in puzzle games that boost your IQ: \"Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle\". Especially, with new woody theme game, you will experience a whole new world of untangling twisted knots. For those seeking a relaxing and brain-boosting pastime during leisure hours, look no further than \"Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle.\"\r\n\r\nHow to play \"Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle\":\r\n- Carefully untie the ropes and try not to make more knots\r\n- Tap and drag the ropes, strategically placing it to the right hole and untangle all knots.\r\n- Arrange the ropes in the correct sequence.\r\n- Think fast and move the ropes strategically\r\n- Successfully untangle all the ropes to claim victory and gain rewards\r\n\r\nKey features of \"Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle\":\r\n- Immerse yourself in stunning one-of-a-kind 3D wood puzzle game \r\n- Challenge yourself with over 1000 levels featuring various maps and difficulty levels.\r\n- Explore a bunch of ropes skin, adorable emotional pins and picturesque background scenes.\r\n- Enjoy the powerful boosters party to overcome all difficult challenges\r\n- Surpass other players in thrilling racing competitions\r\n- Leave your mark on the global map as you conquer thousands of rivals on the leaderboard.\r\n- Gain precious rewards everyday\r\n\r\n\"Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle\" create an atmosphere conducive to relaxation. A brand new woody adventure is waiting to bring enjoyable and fun-filled gaming experience to you!\r\n\r\nAre you ready to untie the multiple knots that lie ahead? Download now and discover how far you can go on your journey of untangling joy!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Embark on a journey into the wood with a brand new theme game &quot;Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle&quot;. Immerse yourself in this vibrant 3D gaming experience that combines simplicity with a delightful level of challenge, ensuring you&#39;ll be captivated in no time.<br><br>It&#39;s time to nurture your cognitive abilities by engaging in puzzle games that boost your IQ: &quot;Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle&quot;. Especially, with new woody theme game, you will experience a whole new world of untangling twisted knots. For those seeking a relaxing and brain-boosting pastime during leisure hours, look no further than &quot;Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle.&quot;<br><br>How to play &quot;Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle&quot;:<br>- Carefully untie the ropes and try not to make more knots<br>- Tap and drag the ropes, strategically placing it to the right hole and untangle all knots.<br>- Arrange the ropes in the correct sequence.<br>- Think fast and move the ropes strategically<br>- Successfully untangle all the ropes to claim victory and gain rewards<br><br>Key features of &quot;Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle&quot;:<br>- Immerse yourself in stunning one-of-a-kind 3D wood puzzle game <br>- Challenge yourself with over 1000 levels featuring various maps and difficulty levels.<br>- Explore a bunch of ropes skin, adorable emotional pins and picturesque background scenes.<br>- Enjoy the powerful boosters party to overcome all difficult challenges<br>- Surpass other players in thrilling racing competitions<br>- Leave your mark on the global map as you conquer thousands of rivals on the leaderboard.<br>- Gain precious rewards everyday<br><br>&quot;Woody Untangle Rope 3D Puzzle&quot; create an atmosphere conducive to relaxation. A brand new woody adventure is waiting to bring enjoyable and fun-filled gaming experience to you!<br><br>Are you ready to untie the multiple knots that lie ahead? Download now and discover how far you can go on your journey of untangling joy!",
